Z||000007||rogergarrison||10-16-2001||05:26 PM||||Testa Rossa is almost as hard as a Countach kit. To get it rite too, you need to get longer rear control arms and axles to move the wheels out a lot farther than deep offset wheels can do. Some people use adapters/spacers instead and there dangerous as h-ll.||||reg||1
